# MCP server
mcp/node_modules/
# mcp/package-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored: the MCP server is a bundled
# tool whose dist/index.js is committed and shipped to consumers, so its build
# must be reproducible (and CI runs `npm ci`, which requires the lockfile).

